WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.461
Ringo had a Space Patrol mission.

2
00:00:06.462 --> 00:00:19.504
But first he had to fix Bot.

3
00:00:19.505 --> 00:00:28.722
Ringo took Bot to a lab.

4
00:00:28.723 --> 00:00:39.116
He found a Quick Charger.

5
00:00:39.117 --> 00:00:45.916
Ringo charged Bot.

6
00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:50.512
Whirr! Ding! Bot's light turned on.

7
00:00:50.513 --> 00:00:55.505
"Yay!" Ringo said.

8
00:00:55.506 --> 00:01:00.308
"Hello!" Bot said.

9
00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:02.509
She spun around.

10
00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.314
Squeak! Clank! Clunk!

11
00:01:06.315 --> 00:01:12.707
"Oh boy," Bot said. "I'm in bad shape.

12
00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:16.077
I can't move my arms!"

13
00:01:16.078 --> 00:01:20.415
"I can fix that," Ringo said.

14
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:24.647
He checked Bot's arms.

15
00:01:24.648 --> 00:01:27.772
Some bolts were loose.

16
00:01:27.773 --> 00:01:35.643
Ringo looked around.

17
00:01:35.644 --> 00:01:45.247
"I wish I had a wrench," he said.

18
00:01:45.248 --> 00:01:53.822
He turned the bolts with his fingers.

19
00:01:53.823 --> 00:01:59.145
Bot moved her arms.

20
00:01:59.146 --> 00:02:02.754
"That's much better!" she said.

21
00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:11.131
Ringo smiled. "We're not done yet."

22
00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:22.883
He cleaned up Bot's rust.

23
00:02:22.884 --> 00:02:29.785
Next he fixed the dents.

24
00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:40.085
Then he sprayed new paint on her.

25
00:02:40.086 --> 00:02:45.122
"You're perfect now!" Ringo said.

26
00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:48.238
Bot blinked. "Really?"

27
00:02:48.239 --> 00:02:52.042
Ringo nodded. "Really!"

28
00:02:52.043 --> 00:02:56.430
"I'm old," Bot said.

29
00:02:56.431 --> 00:03:00.974
"But I can help you with missions."

30
00:03:00.975 --> 00:03:05.039
"Do you know where Blue Moon is?" Ringo asked.

31
00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.841
"Yes," Bot said.

32
00:03:07.842 --> 00:03:11.439
Bot's map lit up. Bing!

33
00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:16.080
"Great," Ringo said. "Let's get a spaceship.

34
00:03:16.081 --> 00:03:24.216
Then we can blast off!"

